<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="es" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2000"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1000"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">Oh</text><text for="L2">Fonsi</text><text for="L3">DY</text><text for="L4">Oh, oh, no, oh, no</text><text for="L5">Oh</text><text for="L6">Hey, yeah</text><text for="L7">Ti-ri, ti-ri, ti-ri-ri-ri, Daddy</text><text for="L8">Go</text><text for="L9">Yes, you know I've been looking at you for a while</text><text for="L10">I have to dance with you today <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(DY)</span></text><text for="L11">I saw that the look in your eyes was calling me</text><text for="L12">Show me the path, 'cause I'll go there</text><text for="L13">Oh, you, you're the magnet and I'm the metal</text><text for="L14">I'm getting closer and making a plan</text><text for="L15">Just thinking about it makes my heart race</text><text for="L16">Now, I'm already liking it more than usual</text><text for="L17">All my senses are asking for more</text><text for="L18">We have to take this step by step</text><text for="L19">Slowly</text><text for="L20">I want to breathe down your neck slowly</text><text for="L21">Let me whisper things in your ear</text><text for="L22">So that you remember when you're not with me <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Pra, pra)</span></text><text for="L23">Slowly</text><text for="L24">I want to slowly strip you naked with kisses</text><text for="L25">Leave a mark on the walls of your labyrinth</text><text for="L26">And to make a manuscript out of your body <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Up, up, up)</span></text><text for="L27">I want to see your hair dance, I want to be your rhythm <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Uh-oh, uh-oh)</span></text><text for="L28">I want you to show my mouth <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Uh-oh, uh-oh)</span></text><text for="L29">Your favorite places <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Favorite, favorite, baby)</span></text><text for="L30">Let me trespass your danger zones <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Uh-oh, uh-oh)</span></text><text for="L31">Until I make you scream <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Uh-oh, uh-oh)</span></text><text for="L32">And you forget your last name <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Daddy, DY)</span></text><text for="L33">If I ask for a kiss, come, give it to me</text><text for="L34">I know you're thinking about it</text><text for="L35">I've been trying to do it for a while</text><text for="L36">Mami, you give it to me, I give it to you</text><text for="L37">You know that, with me, your heart goes bam-bam</text><text for="L38">You know that my baby wants my bam-bam</text><text for="L39">Come, try my mouth to see how it tastes</text><text for="L40">I want, I want, I want to see how much love fits inside you</text><text for="L41">I'm not in a rush, I want to take my time</text><text for="L42">We start slowly, then we go wild</text><text for="L43">One step at a time</text><text for="L44">Smooth, smooth</text><text for="L45">We are getting closer to each other</text><text for="L46">When you kiss me with such skill</text><text for="L47">I see that you're wicked but gentle</text><text for="L48">One step at a time</text><text for="L49">Smooth, smooth</text><text for="L50">We are getting closer to each other <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Oh, oh)</span></text><text for="L51">And that beauty is a puzzle <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Oh-uh, oh)</span></text><text for="L52">But I have the missing piece to finish it, hey <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Slow)</span></text><text for="L53">Slowly <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Yeah, go)</span></text><text for="L54">I want to breathe down your neck slowly</text><text for="L55">Let me whisper things to your ear</text><text for="L56">So that you remember you're not with me <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Pra, pra)</span></text><text for="L57">Slowly <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Pra)</span></text><text for="L58">I want to slowly strip you naked with kisses <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Yeah-eh)</span></text><text for="L59">Leave a mark on the walls of your labyrinth</text><text for="L60">And to make a manuscript out of your body <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Up, up, up)</span></text><text for="L61">I want to see your hair dance, I want to be your rhythm <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Uh-oh, uh-oh)</span></text><text for="L62">I want you to show my mouth <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Uh-oh, uh-oh)</span></text><text for="L63">Your favorite places <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Favorite, favorite, baby)</span></text><text for="L64">Let me trespass your danger zones <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Uh-oh, uh-oh)</span></text><text for="L65">Until I make you scream <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Uh-oh, uh-oh)</span></text><text for="L66">And you forget your last name</text><text for="L67">Slowly</text><text for="L68">Let's do it on a beach in Puerto Rico</text><text for="L69">Until the waves scream, "Oh, my God"</text><text for="L70">So I leave a mark on you <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Dance it)</span></text><text for="L71">One step at a time</text><text for="L72">Smooth, smooth</text><text for="L73">We are getting closer to each other</text><text for="L74">I want you to show my mouth <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Uh-oh, uh-oh)</span></text><text for="L75">Your favorite places <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Favorite, favorite, baby)</span></text><text for="L76">One step at a time</text><text for="L77">Smooth, smooth</text><text for="L78">We are getting closer to each other</text><text for="L79">Until I make you scream <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Fonsi)</span></text><text for="L80">And you forget your last name <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(DY)</span></text><text for="L81">Slowly</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Daddy Yankee</songwriter><songwriter>Erika Ender</songwriter><songwriter>Justin Bieber</songwriter><songwriter>Luis Fonsi</songwriter><songwriter>Marty James</songwriter><songwriter>Poo Bear</songwriter></songwriters><audio lyricOffset="0.222" role="spatial"/></iTunesMetadata>
